---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About FranchiseVista | Franchise Consulting India"
  description="FranchiseVista helps franchise brands appoint qualified franchisees and helps investors find the right brand. Based in Noida, Bengaluru and Mumbai."
  currentPage="about"
>

<section class="hero hero-sub on-dark" aria-labelledby="h1">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-in">
      <span class="eyebrow">About us</span>
      <h1 id="h1">We bridge the gap between brands and investors.</h1>
      <p class="lead">FranchiseVista is a franchise consulting and lead generation company. We help brands appoint the right franchisees and help investors choose the right brand.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="what-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="split-text">
        <span class="eyebrow">What we do</span>
        <h2 id="what-h">Consulting and lead generation, not a directory.</h2>
        <p>Most franchise platforms show you a list and leave you to sort it out. We work with both sides: qualifying brands before we represent them and qualifying investors before we introduce them. That means less wasted time for everyone.</p>
        <p>We work on a small retainer from brands and charge nothing to investors. Our incentive is to close the right match, not to generate the highest number of enquiries.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="split-img">
        <img src="/assets/bg_india.webp" alt="India map showing franchise locations" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec bg-pale" aria-labelledby="how-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">How we work</span>
      <h2 id="how-h">Different approaches for brands and investors.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid g2">
      <article class="card">
        <img class="ico" src="/assets/icon_partner.webp" alt="" width="56" height="56" loading="lazy">
        <h3>With brands</h3>
        <p>We sign a consulting agreement, audit your franchise model and documentation, then run multi-channel lead generation on your behalf. Every enquiry is pre-qualified before it reaches you. We write weekly dashboards and monthly reviews so you always know what is in the pipeline.</p>
        <ul class="checks">
          <li>Franchise model audit before launch</li>
          <li>Multi-channel digital lead generation</li>
          <li>Pre-qualification before introduction</li>
          <li>Weekly and monthly reporting</li>
          <li>Support through negotiation and signing</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <img class="ico" src="/assets/icon_invest.webp" alt="" width="56" height="56" loading="lazy">
        <h3>With investors</h3>
        <p>You tell us your budget, location and what you are looking for. We suggest brands that match, explain the terms clearly, arrange introductions and stay with you through due diligence and signing. We charge you nothing.</p>
        <ul class="checks">
          <li>Free service for investors</li>
          <li>Shortlist based on budget and location</li>
          <li>Plain-English explanation of terms</li>
          <li>Introduction to brand and outlet visit</li>
          <li>Support through due diligence and signing</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="approach-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our approach</span>
      <h2 id="approach-h">Four things we believe in.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid g4">
      <article class="card crit-card">
        <img class="ico" src="/assets/icon_research.webp" alt="" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy">
        <h3>Qualify before introducing</h3>
        <p>We screen investors for financial capacity, seriousness and location fit before the brand ever speaks to them.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card crit-card">
        <img class="ico" src="/assets/icon_consult.webp" alt="" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy">
        <h3>Be clear about risk</h3>
        <p>Franchise investments carry risk. We say that plainly and make sure both sides understand the terms before signing.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card crit-card">
        <img class="ico" src="/assets/icon_diligence.webp" alt="" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy">
        <h3>Let investors meet the brand</h3>
        <p>We arrange outlet visits and direct conversations with the brand so investors can form their own view.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card crit-card">
        <img class="ico" src="/assets/icon_contracts.webp" alt="" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy">
        <h3>Negotiate within terms</h3>
        <p>We help both sides reach a fair agreement within the brand's standard franchise agreement, not around it.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta" aria-labelledby="cta-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-in">
      <h2 id="cta-h">Talk to us about your situation.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Whether you are a brand looking to grow or an investor looking for the right franchise, we are happy to have an initial conversation at no cost.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/contact">Get in touch</a>
        <a class="btn btn-wa" href="https://wa.me/919667395517" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Message on WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
      <p class="cta-meta">
        <span>Vikas Gupta</span>
        <a href="tel:+919667395517">+91 96673 95517</a>
        <a href="mailto:franchisevista@growthoriginator.in">franchisevista@growthoriginator.in</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
